+!++AS
+! OVERRIDE of CAM src/physics/carma/cam/carma_intr.F90 (CAM cam_cesm2_1_rel_60), for
+! the CARMA arsenic_msp model. This copy is found before cam/ because the model
+! directory comes first in the build Filepath (bld/configure). Changes are bracketed
+! by !++AS / !--AS:
+!   1) carma_register: add the CARMA gas as a CAM constituent if it does not exist
+!      (cnst_get_ind with abort=.false., then cnst_add); remember which gases were
+!      added here (carma_added_gas).
+!   2) carma_init: history fields <gas> (only for gases added in 1) and <gas>EM.
+!   3) carma_emission_tend: gas emission from CARMA_EmitGas (carma_model_mod).
+!   4) carma_init_cnst: initialize gas constituents to 0 where mask is true.
+! See README.md and carma_intr.F90.patch in this directory.
+!--AS
 !! This module is a coupler between the CAM model and the Community Aerosol
 !! and Radiation Model for Atmospheres (CARMA) microphysics model. It adds the
 !! capabilities of CARMA to CAM, allowing for binned microphysics studies
